1. If Staff is having only FTS export permission:
   case 1: There are only FTS Project available and no RFT Project on UI --> Export without warning
   case 2: There are FTS and RFT Projects available on UI --> Export with warning with Yes and No
   case 3: There are only RFT projects available on UI and no FTS Project --> No export and warning with ok
 
 
2. If Staff is having only RFT export permission:
   case 1: There are only FTS Project available and no RFT Project on UI --> No export and warning with ok
   case 2: There are FTS and RFT Projects available on UI --> Export with warning with Yes and No
   case 3: There are only RFT projects available on UI and no FTS Project --> Export without warning
3. If staff is having both permissions:
   case 1: There are only FTS Project available and no RFT Project on UI --> Export without warning
   case 2: There are FTS and RFT Projects available on UI --> Export without warning
   case 3: There are only RFT projects available on UI and no FTS Project --> Export without warning
